e;rounded=1;html=1;jettySize=24;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeColor=#3f8f43;strokeWidth=1.6;startArrow=ERone;startFill=0;endArrow=ERmany;endFill=0;fontSize=10;fontColor=#14261a;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;verticalAlign=bottom;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="t136" target="t200"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e244" value="N : 1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;jettySize=24;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeColor=#3f8f43;strokeWidth=1.6;startArrow=ERone;startFill=0;endArrow=ERmany;endFill=0;fontSize=10;fontColor=#14261a;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;verticalAlign=bottom;" edge="1" parent="1" source="t181" target="t216"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="z245" value="LEGEND

PK   primary key
FK   foreign key (plain BIGINT column)
UQ   unique constraint

──  declared relationship
┄┄  logical link resolved in the
       service layer" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F4FFE9;strokeColor=#14493B;fontSize=11;fontColor=#14261a;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=6;verticalAlign=top;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="420" width="360" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="z246" value="FOREIGN KEYS ARE PLAIN COLUMNS

Modelled as BIGINT rather than JPA
relations. Names are resolved in the
service layer via workerMap() and
zoneMap().

Deliberate: it keeps query behaviour
explicit and avoids unintended
lazy loading." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F4FFE9;strokeColor=#3f8f43;fontSize=11;fontColor=#14261a;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=6;verticalAlign=top;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="640" width="360" height="250" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="z247" value="MONEY INVARIANTS

1.  finance_ledger.amount is always
     ≥ 0. Direction comes from category
     + source_type, never a minus sign.

2.  daily_settlement moves DEBT only.
     to_loan + to_advance +
     to_overdraw + payable = earned.

3.  Cash leaves the estate in exactly
     one place: sending a batch.

4.  Postings are idempotent on
     (source_type, source_id)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF8E6;strokeColor=#B7791F;fontSize=11;fontColor=#14261a;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=6;verticalAlign=top;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="920" width="360" height="300" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>